# oracle: atom_style body rounded/polygon (2d squares, N = 4 vertices, rounded diameter 0.5, Izz 2.67 as given) with fix nve/body and no contact (pair zero); the bodies move with initial velocities and angular momenta, 100 steps; thermo pe ke etotal and the atom state (COM positions and velocities)
# oracle-inputs: w49bp_squares.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
units           lj
dimension       2
atom_style      body rounded/polygon 1 6
read_data       w49bp_squares.data
velocity        all set 0.1 -0.05 0.0
set             atom 2 angmom 0 0 0.5
pair_style      zero 1.0
pair_coeff      * *
fix             1 all nve/body
fix             2 all enforce2d
thermo_style    custom step pe ke etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             100
